### Criar usuario para autenticacao
POST {{Ambev.DeveloperEvaluation.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/Users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "Admin",
  "password": "Admin@123",
  "phone": "11912345678",
  "email": "admin@developerstore.com",
  "status": 1,
  "role": 3
}

### Autenticar usuario e copiar o token retornado para @JwtToken
POST {{Ambev.DeveloperEvaluation.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/Auth
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@developerstore.com",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### Buscar usuario por id com bearer token
### Atualize @UserId com o data.id retornado no POST de criacao
GET {{Ambev.DeveloperEvaluation.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/Users/{{UserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Criar venda com item sem desconto e item com 10%
POST {{Ambev.DeveloperEvaluation.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/Sales
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "saleNumber": "SALE-20260425-001",
  "saleDate": "2026-04-25T14:30:00Z",
  "customerExternalId": "CUST-1001",
  "customerName": "Maria Oliveira",
  "branchExternalId": "BR-01",
  "branchName": "Filial Centro",
  "items": [
    {
      "productExternalId": "PROD-001",
      "productName": "Cerveja Pilsen 350ml",
      "quantity": 3,
      "unitPrice": 5.50
    },
    {
      "productExternalId": "PROD-002",
      "productName": "Refrigerante Cola 2L",
      "quantity": 4,
      "unitPrice": 9.90
    }
  ]
}

