### Listar vendas
GET {{Ambev.DeveloperEvaluation.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/Sales
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Buscar venda por id
### Atualize @SaleId com o data.id retornado no POST
GET {{Ambev.DeveloperEvaluation.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/Sales/{{SaleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Atualizar venda por id
### Atualize @SaleId com o data.id retornado no POST
PUT {{Ambev.DeveloperEvaluation.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/Sales/{{SaleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "saleNumber": "SALE-20260425-001-UPDATED",
  "saleDate": "2026-04-25T16:00:00Z",
  "customerExternalId": "CUST-1001",
  "customerName": "Maria Oliveira Atualizada",
  "branchExternalId": "BR-01",
  "branchName": "Filial Centro",
  "isCancelled": false,
  "items": [
    {
      "productExternalId": "PROD-001",
      "productName": "Cerveja Pilsen 350ml",
      "quantity": 5,
      "unitPrice": 5.50,
      "isCancelled": false
    },
    {
      "productExternalId": "PROD-004",
      "productName": "Suco Laranja 1L",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 7.00,
      "isCancelled": false
    }
  ]
}

### Cancelar venda no update
### Atualize @SaleId com o data.id retornado no POST
PUT {{Ambev.DeveloperEvaluation.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/Sales/{{SaleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "saleNumber": "SALE-20260425-001-UPDATED",
  "saleDate": "2026-04-25T16:00:00Z",
  "customerExternalId": "CUST-1001",
  "customerName": "Maria Oliveira Atualizada",
  "branchExternalId": "BR-01",
  "branchName": "Filial Centro",
  "isCancelled": true,
  "items": [
    {
      "productExternalId": "PROD-001",
      "productName": "Cerveja Pilsen 350ml",
      "quantity": 5,
      "unitPrice": 5.50,
      "isCancelled": false
    }
  ]
}

### Excluir venda por id
### Atualize @SaleId com o data.id retornado no POST
DELETE {{Ambev.DeveloperEvaluation.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/Sales/{{SaleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}
Accept: application/json
